# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (Alliance 12-20 zone order): an Eastern Kingdoms loop between Darkshore's
# northern loops (03-darkshore, to about 18) and its southern ones (03-darkshore-return, from
# about 20), where Loch Modan's and Redridge's 15-20 quests still give full XP. Before, the
# route had no Loch Modan visit after the starts, did Redridge's 15-18 quests at 24 for a
# fraction of their XP, never took the Defias chain past Wiley, and entered Ashenvale at 20
# with a grind there.
#
# Flow: the boat to Menethil Harbor -> the Wetlands road and Dun Algaz -> Loch Modan from the
# north: the Algaz Station and the Silver Stream Mine, the Stonewrought Dam, the loch's
# toolbox, Thelsamar (flight path), Ironband's Excavation, the Farstrider Lodge and its hunts,
# Thelsamar, Ylva's banner and the tunnel post -> Dun Morogh (Dwarves and Gnomes, who have the Ironforge flight path
# from their start, fly from Thelsamar instead: #1508) -> Ironforge (flight path) ->
# the tram -> Stormwind -> Elwynn -> Redridge: Three Corners, Lakeshire (flight path) and the
# loop west and south of the lake -> the walk west through Goldshire (Smith Argus) to Sentinel
# Hill -> Stormwind by gryphon (Shaw, General Marcus) and back -> Moonbrook (People's Militia
# part 2 and Alba's crates, moved here from 02-westfall's second half), the lighthouse, the
# traitor's escort -> the gryphon to Lakeshire -> the gnoll hills north of the lake ->
# Lakeshire, then back to Auberdine: the gryphon to Stormwind (Sprite Jumpsprocket, Baros Alexston
# for Expanding Horizons, whose reply goes to Thundris where the boat lands) and the boat, or the
# Hearthstone (still bound there since the first Darkshore visit).
# The Westfall stretch needs The Defias Brotherhood (65) from 02-westfall: a player who loads
# this guide without it goes from Goldshire to Stormwind's gate (General Marcus) and flies
# back to Lakeshire instead.
#
# Crocolisk Hunting (385) rides on the lodge stops: Loch Crocolisks drop its meat and skins
# (players' recordings: skins and meat looted in Loch Modan, hand-ins at about 17).
# Stormpike's Delivery (353), from Grimand Elmore after Elmore's Task on 02-westfall's last Stormwind
# stop (Humans), is handed to Mountaineer Stormpike on the first Algaz Station stop.
# Human Paladins: The Tome of Divinity (1786, 1787, from Gazin Tenorm on 02-westfall's last Stormwind stop) on
# this guide's walk east through Elwynn (Henze Faulk at Stone Cairn Lake, north of the bridge) and Redemption
# (1788) at the Cathedral of Light on its last Stormwind stop, at about 20-21 instead of 04's Elwynn road and
# 05's Stormwind stop at about 26 (those steps stay for a Paladin still carrying the quests).
# Left out:
# A Dark Threat Looms (161) goes on to Ashlan Stonesmirk at Whelgar's dig, three levels later.
# Mountaineer Stormpike's Task and Stormpike's Order (1339, 1338): Kadrell's breadcrumb, and
# the route reaches Stormpike from the north first (Filthy Paws, 307, has no prerequisite).
# The tunnel post's trogg chain (224, 237, 263, 217): sixty trogg kills and four trips between
# the post and Stonesplinter Valley. Bingles (2039, 2038): Find Bingles starts in Ironforge.
# Mercenaries and Vyrin's Revenge (255, 271): elite. Keeper of the Flame (103): taken and handed
# in at once on the lighthouse stop, only by a player carrying five Flasks of Oil (a free drop of
# the Harvest Watchers 02-westfall kills; it says to keep five), never a trip for the flasks.
# Messenger to Westfall and Darkshire (143, 145): another round trip each.
# Marshal Marris's Blackrock quests (20, 98387), Alther's Mill (98386) and Murloc Poachers (150,
# from 20) are taken here, at their givers, and done on the 24 visit (04-redridge-mountains), where
# level 20-21 quests still give full XP. Givers passed and left for later, by level: A Watchful Eye
# (94, from 20: players pass the Tower of Azora at 19-20, and its statue is worked on the 24 visit,
# where Theocritus gives it), Mathias and the Defias for Rogues (2360, from 20: a Human Rogue is
# 19.x on the SI:7 stop; 06-ashenvale's Stormwind stop gives it),
# Solomon's Law (91, level 23; Galardell's Shadowhide gnolls are 23-25, worked at 24), Blackrock Bounty and An Unwelcome Guest (128, 34: levels 24-25),
# the Wanted posters (elites, 24+), and on the boat into Menethil The Greenwarden, Young Crocolisk
# Skins and Spoils of War (463, 484, 98197: level 21-22, 3+ over at 18.7; taken at 22-24).
#
# The Deadmines (`when dungeon "The Deadmines"`, dungeons in the route): for a character who
# chose it, Gryan's and Scout Riell's quests are picked up when the Defias chain ends at Sentinel Hill
# (about level 20; that stop's own step, the hand-in and the flight, is the solo way, behind `when
# !dungeon`), the run follows, and the hand-ins are Sentinel Hill's tower and Baros Alexston (the Unsent
# Letter) on the Stormwind stop before the boat (`when dungeon` and `when complete`/`when onquest`, so a
# run left unfinished passes them). Left out on the route's travel budget (the flow audit
# measured +2.0 km and +5 hub visits with them, +0 without): Underground Assault (2040,
# Gnoarn in Ironforge, Shoni in Stormwind's Dwarven District) and Oh Brother... (167, Wilder
# Thistlenettle there); also Collecting Memories (168: slow drops), Destruction in Deadmines (92753:
# after Alba Fairmoon's 92749-92752, not on the route), the Paladin's Test of Righteousness (class guide).
#
# The Hall of Thanes (`when dungeon "The Hall of Thanes"`, dungeons in the route): for a character who chose
# it, Thom Filch's Important Heirlooms (96403) and Afadra Dunwall's The Restless Dead (96394) are taken on the
# Ironforge stop at about 19.5 (level 15 quests, full XP to about 21), the run follows from the hall's door
# on the city's west side, a short walk past them (Ironforge 28.2,47.7, where players' recordings go in), and
# both take theirs back at once. King Magni takes Old Ironforge Incursion (96393, Earthseer Farsen's, for a
# Dwarf or Gnome who carries it from Dun Morogh) and the Treaty of Understanding (98423, an item inside). An
# Ancient Grudge (96395) starts and ends inside, with the Ghostly Attendant (the run tip names it).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Loch Modan

step Boat to Menethil Harbor
  zone Darkshore
  tip Sell and repair in Auberdine first: the next stretch is a long one.
  vendor nearest optional
  goto 32.4,43.8 "Boat to Menethil Harbor"

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  tip Off the boat, walk up the pier to the flight master by the inn. Nothing to take here yet: Menethil's quests are for your Wetlands visit at about 22.
  getfp "Menethil Harbor"

step Into Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Follow the road east out of Menethil and south through the Dun Algaz pass. Keep to the road: the Wetlands crocolisks and raptors beside it are over your level.
  goto 25.6,10.5 "Into Loch Modan"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North Loch Modan

step Algaz Station
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne
  tip Mountaineer Stormpike stands at the Algaz Station, at the south end of the pass.
  accept 307                                  -- Mountaineer Stormpike

step Mountaineer Stormpike
  when onquest 353
  turnin 353                                  -- Mountaineer Stormpike: Grimand Elmore's package

step Silver Stream Mine
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne
  tip East along the hills to the mine: the Miners' League crates sit in its tunnels among the Tunnel Rat kobolds.
  collect 2640 quest 307                      -- Miners' Gear, from the crates; below ground

step Back to the Algaz Station
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne
  turnin 307                                  -- Mountaineer Stormpike

step Stonewrought Dam
  tip Chief Engineer Hinderweir stands on top of the dam, up the ramp at its west end.
  accept 250                                  -- Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII

step The Suspicious Barrel
  tip Walk east along the dam, down its eastern ramp, then back west along the foot of the dam on the land side: two Dark Iron Sappers guard the barrel. Kill them, then open the barrel: it ends this quest and starts the next.
  turnin 250                                  -- Suspicious Barrel
  accept 199

step Stonewrought Dam
  turnin 199                                  -- Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thelsamar

step The loch
  tip South along the west shore. The Discarded Fishing Toolbox lies on the loch bed at one of several places: east of Thelsamar (48.1,39.7), a little south-west of there (45.7,43.4), or at the south end of the loch (48.7,54.4 or 50.6,53.3). If it isn't at the arrow, try the next place. Click it for the quest; the Monogrammed Silver Hair Clip comes with it.
  accept 86614                                -- Discarded Fishing Toolbox; underwater

step Thelsamar
  tip Khara Deepwater stands on the shore north-east of town, Jern Hornhelm by the inn.
  turnin 86614                                -- Khara Deepwater
  accept 436                                  -- Jern Hornhelm

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironband's Excavation

step Ironband's Excavation
  tip Round the south end of the loch and head east to the dig. Magmar Fellhew and Prospector Ironband stand together at its west edge.
  turnin 436                                  -- Magmar Fellhew
  accept 297
  accept 298                                  -- Prospector Ironband

step The dig site
  tip Stonesplinter Diggers, Geomancers and Berserk Troggs hold the dig east of Ironband; any of them can drop a Carved Stone Idol. Piles of Excavation Tools lie around the dig: open one and right-click the tools to start Excavation Tools, then gather six.
  tip Careful: Berserk Troggs (19-20) enrage below 40% health.
  collect 278049 x1                           -- Excavation Tools: open a pile at the dig
  accept 86613                                -- Right-click the Excavation Tools
  collect 2636 quest 297                      -- Carved Stone Idol
  collect 278398 quest 86613                  -- Excavation Tools

step Ironband's Excavation
  turnin 297                                  -- Magmar Fellhew
  turnin 86613                                -- Prospector Ironband

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Farstrider Lodge

step The Farstrider Lodge
  tip North-east to the lodge on the hill. Marek Ironheart stands inside, Daryl the Youngling outside.
  accept 86758                                -- Marek Ironheart, inside
  accept 385                                  -- Marek Ironheart: the loch crocolisks below the lodge
  accept 257                                  -- Daryl the Youngling: 15 minutes

