step Elder Mountain Boars
  tip The Elder Mountain Boars roam the hills north-west of the lodge, along the east shore. A Hunter's Challenge runs for 12 minutes: kill five and go straight back to Daryl; the crocolisks come after.
  kill 1192 quest 258                         -- Elder Mountain Boar

step Daryl the Youngling
  turnin 258

step Daggerfang and the loch crocolisks
  tip Back down to the east shore below the boars' hills: Daggerfang, a crocolisk, patrols it among the Loch Crocolisks.
  collect 279591 quest 86758                  -- Marek's Croc-Hunting Knife: Daggerfang
  collect 2924 quest 385                      -- Crocolisk Meat: Loch Crocolisks
  collect 2925 quest 385                      -- Crocolisk Skin

step The Farstrider Lodge
  turnin 86758                                -- Marek Ironheart, inside
