# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Fly to Ironforge
  when taxi "Ironforge"
  zone Loch Modan
  tip You have the Ironforge flight path: back north to Thelsamar's gryphons, quicker than walking through the tunnel and across Dun Morogh.
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Into Dun Morogh
  when !taxi "Ironforge"
  when !zone "Ironforge"
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Through the South Gate tunnel and west along the road to Ironforge. Know the Ironforge flight path already? Fly from Thelsamar instead: these two waypoints drop once you are in the city.
  goto 86.0,49.6 "Into Dun Morogh"

step Into Ironforge
  when !taxi "Ironforge"
  when !zone "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge
  goto 21.6,77.8 "Into Ironforge"

step Thom Filch and Afadra Dunwall
  when dungeon "The Hall of Thanes"
  zone Ironforge
  tip For your Hall of Thanes run: Thom Filch and Afadra Dunwall stand a few steps apart on the city's west side, west of the High Seat. The hall's door is a short walk further west.
  accept 96403                        -- Thom Filch
  accept 96394                        -- Afadra Dunwall

step The Hall of Thanes
  when dungeon "The Hall of Thanes"
  when onquest 96403,96394,96393
  zone Ironforge
  tip The Hall of Thanes is a dungeon for a group of five at about level 15 to 16, under Ironforge. Its door is on the west side of the city, a short walk west of Afadra Dunwall.
  tip Inside: the Enraged Apparitions and Tormented Souls are Afadra's, the Dwarven Heirlooms Thom's, and Durgen Dirgehammer, the Dark Iron commander deep in the vaults, carries the head King Magni wants. A Ghostly Attendant inside gives An Ancient Grudge, for Faldrim Anvilmar, and takes it back there; a Treaty of Understanding found inside starts a quest for King Magni.
  enter "The Hall of Thanes" @28.2,47.7 live
  complete 96403 @28.2,47.7 live      -- Important Heirlooms: the heirlooms, inside
  complete 96394 @28.2,47.7 live      -- The Restless Dead, inside
  complete 96393 @28.2,47.7 live      -- Old Ironforge Incursion: Durgen Dirgehammer, inside

step Thom Filch
  when dungeon "The Hall of Thanes"
  when complete 96403
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 96403                        -- Thom Filch

step Afadra Dunwall
  when dungeon "The Hall of Thanes"
  when complete 96394
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 96394                        -- Afadra Dunwall

step King Magni Bronzebeard
  when dungeon "The Hall of Thanes"
  when complete 96393
  zone Ironforge
  tip Old Ironforge Incursion: King Magni sits on the High Seat, east of the hall's door.
