# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North of the lake

step Lakeshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip From the gryphons, over the bridge into town: Verner Osgood by the smithy, Magistrate Solomon in the town hall.
  turnin 119                                  -- Verner Osgood
  accept 122
  accept 124
  turnin 121                                  -- Magistrate Solomon, in the town hall

step Redridge Canyons
  tip Redridge Brutes and Mystics hold the hills north and north-west of town; both carry the Iron Pikes and Rivets. Black Dragon Whelps nest in the same hills.
  tip Careful: The whelps cast Fireball from range, and the gnolls run for help at low health.
  kill 426 quest 124                          -- Redridge Brute
  kill 430 quest 124                          -- Redridge Mystic
  collect 2856 quest 89                       -- Iron Pike
  collect 1013 quest 89                       -- Iron Rivet
  collect 1221 quest 122                      -- Underbelly Whelp Scale: Black Dragon Whelps

step Lakeshire
  tip Back down into town: Verner Osgood by the smithy, Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, Dockmaster Baren on the docks.
  turnin 124                                  -- Verner Osgood
  turnin 122
  turnin 89                                   -- Foreman Oslow
  accept 98386                                -- Foreman Oslow: Alther's Mill, for your next Redridge visit
  accept 150                                  -- Dockmaster Baren, on the docks: the murlocs are for your next Redridge visit

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to Darkshore

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Back to Auberdine for Darkshore's southern loops: the gryphon to Stormwind, then the boat from the harbour.
  goto 25.5,59.4 "Lakeshire flight master" live
  fly "Stormwind"

step Sprite Jumpsprocket
  when onquest 92748
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 92748                                -- Sprite Jumpsprocket, Dwarven District

step Baros Alexston
  when onquest 97914
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Baros Alexston stands at the east side of Cathedral Square, on the way from the Dwarven District to the harbour.
  turnin 97914                                -- Baros Alexston: Thundris' letter from Auberdine
  accept 97926 optional                       -- For Thundris Windweaver, where the boat lands

step Baros Alexston
  when dungeon "The Deadmines"
  when onquest 373
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Baros Alexston, the city architect, is on your way west to the harbour. His next errand, Bazil Thredd, leads into the Stockade: it is for a Stockade run at about 29, so leave it unless you chose that dungeon.
  turnin 373                                  -- Baros Alexston

step Baros Alexston
  when dungeon "The Stockade"
  zone Stormwind City
  tip For your Stockade run, later in Stormwind: keep it until then.
  accept 389                                  -- Baros Alexston: for Warden Thelwater, at the Stockade's gate

step Gazin Tenorm
  only Human,Paladin
  zone Stormwind City
  when onquest 1787,1788
  tip Gazin Tenorm and Duthorian Rall are in the Cathedral of Light, on Cathedral Square, on the way to the harbour.
  goto 50.5,47.5 "Cathedral of Light" live
  turnin 1787 only Human -- Gazin Tenorm
  accept 1788 only Human
  turnin 1788 only Human -- Duthorian Rall: Redemption

step Boat to Auberdine
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 22.71,56.69 "Boat to Auberdine" live
